WEBVTT

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.410
The Mongols will be here in an hour.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.440
If we want to survive,

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.320
the samurai from the capital 
will have to obey the Toibarai.

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.700
<i>This won't be easy.</i>

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.760
<i>There are a thousand Mongols,</i>

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.270
<i>and 160 of us, at most.</i>

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:23.960
What are you doing, Kuchii Jinzaburou?

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.300
There we go.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.730
Let's have Nagamine 
show us where we'll all be going.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.510
Is this...

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.630
a model of Kanatanoki Castle?

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:40.440
What?

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.510
That's amazing.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.700
It's really well-made.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:43.780
That exile is good with his hands.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.520
He knows exactly how it looks.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.940
This has been our hidden 
home for generations,

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.360
and he knows its layout exactly...

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:58.360
The bastard is acting like 
he's one of them now.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:01.820
All right. The Mongols are coming 
by land from the south.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.150
If they follow the path,

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.750
they'll end up here at the south gate.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:14.050
We'll place the few defenders 
we have here at the gate.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.360
How many men will we put at the west wall,

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:19.270
on top of the mountain?

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:22.150
We can't put that many at the castle's rear,

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.610
so about ten.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:25.380
I see.

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:27.110
<i>You are putting some there...</i>

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:30.020
All right.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.560
I'll go, too.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.420
The west side is a steep cliff.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.020
The enemy will have trouble getting there.

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:38.530
But that's why we need to be careful.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:40.770
That's just like you, Shiraishi-dono.

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:44.250
You're cautious, with an eye for detail.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.610
Surprising, since you look like a bear.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:49.130
That doesn't sound like 
you're complimenting me.

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:50.670
All right.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.500
I'll let you handle it.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.510
Yeah, leave it to me.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:01.080
Everyone else to the south gate...

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:03.530
I'm not going to the south gate, either.

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.150
What do you mean?

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:08.630
I'm going here.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:12.310
Outside?

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:16.980
When guests arrive, 
you need to welcome them...

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:18.980
Right?

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.920
Don't worry too much.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:02.890
If you're quiet, your prey won't flee.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.090
Choukuru-sama, do you think we 
should wait for the scouts?

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:09.890
No. If we're too slow, 
the units behind us will catch up.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:14.780
We need to show General Uriyan Edei 
that we were the first to arrive.

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:17.390
What?

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:19.260
Above us! They're above us!

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:20.660
Where? I can't see them!

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:21.410
Calm down!

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:24.250
Trees aren't supposed to have 
this many leaves at this time of year!

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:28.090
There's more over there!

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:29.170
Fire!

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.110
They found us?

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:33.920
Fire! Fire!

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:36.800
Arrows from below?

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.980
You should've paid attention...

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.630
...to the leaves at your feet!

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:47.850
Attack!

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.020
Two ambushes? One above, and one below!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.010
The bastards!

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.500
Calm down and look carefully!

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.350
There's only a few of them!

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.680
Surround them from both sides!

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:06.020
Okay, let's get out of here!

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.790
Once they calm down, 
the enemy will badly outnumber us!

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:09.410
Run to the castle!

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.770
Don't let them escape!

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:17.400
<i>We strike the enemy off guard 
to manipulate their minds...</i>

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:21.210
<i>Then we bring them to the south 
gate, where our main unit is.</i>

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.830
Close the gate!

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.740
A Japanese mountain castle!

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:28.320
Attack!

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:32.170
Nice work.

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:34.390
You saw the looks on their faces, right?

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.350
I see.

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:42.390
He did that complicated 
ambush with only twenty people

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:45.380
so that the Mongols would 
only choose the south gate.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.070
At least for the first battle,

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:51.170
we'll be able to use our largest force.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.820
Get some rest, Kuchii Jinzaburou.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:57.240
Now, it's my turn.

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.410
All right, everyone!

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:08.170
Let none of them into our holy ground!

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.850
Everyone's attacking 
without waiting for orders.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:23.440
That's what you want in a Mongol soldier.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:27.530
These soldiers attacked lots 
of mountain castles in Goryeo.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:30.750
They know how to do it.

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:32.170
We're going to attack, too!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:33.880
Don't let mere infantry men 
win more glory than you!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.160
They're like turtles...

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.220
They slowly get as close as they can

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:44.100
before rushing for the walls, right?

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:46.000
Tatsu, you give the signal!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.630
Okay! Everyone, get ready!

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.560
Okay!

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.340
Now!

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:56.480
Ready... go!

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:05.580
We can't see what's 
above us behind our shields!

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.480
Ready... go!

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:11.180
So that's how their stone-throwers work.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:13.120
They're well-trained and work together.

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:18.720
Siege weapons?

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:21.400
Don't be afraid! Get close!

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.260
These trees are in the way!

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:23.820
What is this?

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:24.380
Snap them!

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.290
Don't be afraid!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.920
We're putting up the ladder!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.080
Race up the walls!

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:35.170
Here we go...

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:37.520
I've got a present for you.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.610
Make sure you don't drop it.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.650
More are coming up from over there!

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.290
We won't make it in time!

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.710
Shall we attack another gate?

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:55.590
Wait, Choukuru.

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:57.940
We'll keep attacking this gate.

00:07:57.940 --> 00:07:59.770
You came, Funbishi?

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:02.560
With my two hundred, 
we now have four hundred.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.370
That's enough, right?

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:09.630
The general's orders were to keep 
attacking the same place, you see.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.630
General Uriyan Edei said that?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:19.000
But he says to avoid forcing 
an attack and losing soldiers.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.130
He says to take our time.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.110
Go nice and slow.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:29.290
We'll attack a single point to force them 
to concentrate their defenders there.

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:32.670
And then, if we send 
another unit from the other side...

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.530
The castle will fall easily.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:35.450
Yes.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:40.270
Ochirubato's two hundred 
should be reaching the west wall now.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:46.010
Do you think Shiraishi will pull it off?

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:50.050
West Wall

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.010
Damn. The west wall is under attack.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:53.850
Is it okay for us to stay here?

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.670
We can't just stand here.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:56.800
That's right.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:01.240
The south gate may be 
on the verge of falling.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:02.450
If that happens,

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:06.800
the Mongols will head for the 
citadel and attack your families.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.490
Hey...

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.450
Yeah. That's not good.

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.640
Okay, fine.

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:16.470
I'll watch this spot.

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:19.500
You guys go to the south gate.

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:22.400
But if you're alone...

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.710
I'll send the signal if I see any Mongols.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.040
Come back with reinforcements.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.850
Sure.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:30.580
Of course. Thanks!

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:35.910
What's wrong?

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:37.230
You go, too.

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:40.140
No, it's too risky.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:43.980
I'm worried about my family 
in the citadel, as well.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:48.450
You're fighting for us 
even though you're not from our island.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.560
We can't let you stay here alone.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.850
I'll go watch over there.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:59.410
<i>Fool.</i>

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:02.790
<i>You should've just done as you were told...</i>

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.260
How much...

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:09.840
must you make me suffer?

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.040
Mongols!

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:21.430
Hey, traitor.

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.340
You look pretty calm.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:28.030
I hate traitors.

00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:30.740
But Uriyan Edei-sama won't betray you.

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:34.980
You'll be rewarded for your efforts.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.560
Let's go, men!

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:41.230
Be quiet and careful 
as you go down the ladders.

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:43.380
If we catch them in their blind spot,

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:46.800
we'll have all the treasure 
and women we could want!

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:58.000
<i>You can't just betray someone once.</i>

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:02.450
<i>Once you start, you can't stop.</i>

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:05.260
<i>You have to keep going forward.</i>

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:08.870
<i>I feel like I'm getting further 
and further away from Kuchii</i>

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:12.560
<i>and the others fighting at the south gate.</i>

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.640
That's it! The citadel!

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.770
Men, get ready!

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:25.280
South Gate

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:24.970
It's so quiet...

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.450
Hey, Mongols!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.510
What's wrong!?

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:29.880
You're slacking off!

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.420
I guess even a moron 
like you can understand.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:36.510
They aren't getting close enough 
for me to throw logs at them.

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:39.200
There's more Mongols than before,

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.750
but they're being less aggressive.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:44.350
I can't feel any passion 
for taking this gate.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:45.710
What are you saying?

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:47.000
Just come out with it!

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:51.470
They're tying us down here 
while they attack somewhere else.

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:53.440
That's what you're saying, right?

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.620
Somewhere else?

00:11:56.120 --> 00:12:00.180
But we have a small number 
of soldiers at each gate.

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:02.700
If the Mongols attacked, 
we should get a signal.

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:05.540
And...

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:11.560
That's... the citadel!

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.220
What happened?

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:19.800
It's burning...

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:23.230
That's Ochirubato, isn't it?

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:25.850
I didn't tell him he could set fire to it.

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:28.660
That seems to be 
the direction of the citadel.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:31.990
I guess all our treasure will turn to dust.

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.250
Oh, well.

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:36.690
He's a fierce and violent man.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:41.670
Tell the others to attack, 
now that he's burned the citadel.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:47.030
East Wall

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:47.040
Is this the wall closest to the citadel?

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:50.120
Did the flames cause them to retreat?

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.520
Probably.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:55.010
That bastard Ochirubato 
burned the whole damn thing...

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:57.460
Get up the walls! Now!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.530
Don't let him have all the treasure!

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.080
They're burning.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:09.640
Are those the castle's defenders?

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:10.420
No,

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.710
they're not Japanese.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:13.830
They're our men!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.960
Funbishi-sama, 
those are our men, too!

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:16.940
So's that one!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.910
They're all our allies?

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:20.270
What's going on?

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:24.270
Funbishi...

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:28.280
Be careful...

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:33.150
It's a fire... curse!

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:39.460
There it is! The citadel!

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:42.550
Get ready, men!

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:45.560
Ochirubato-sama, look!

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:49.920
The Japanese finally found us, huh?

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:53.710
Crush them! Now!

00:13:55.140 --> 00:14:01.760
Ancestors, we have held 
this castle for five centuries.

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:03.760
Please forgive us for burning it.

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.070
Funbishi-sama!

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:26.270
We should retreat.

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:27.800
The soldiers are scared.

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:41.280
Come closer!

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.940
You shall meet the same fate!

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:47.400
R-Retreat!

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:48.620
Fall back!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.740
We managed to drive them off...

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:59.950
We must protect the citadel at all costs...

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:07.020
Princess!

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:09.370
I came from the south gate to help!

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:10.090
You're late!

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:16.300
Kuchii isn't here...

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.210
Why?

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:21.040
Which is more important? 
This wall or that gate!

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.990
I-I couldn't say...

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:28.200
I can smell the scent of burning flesh...

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:32.850
Slash and burn agriculture 
is common on this island.

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:36.770
The islanders know how to control a flame.

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:40.340
I wish I could've avoided doing this, though.

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:44.030
Forgive me, mountain.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:48.920
I can't wait to see what 
the Mongols do when they see this.

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:53.840
They may go mad and swarm the gate, 
heedless of the causalities.

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:02.220
Maybe we should attack them!

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:08.610
Ochirubato!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.890
How did this happen?

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:15.460
He and his men were burned 
to death by an enemy trap.

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:23.240
If I may, General,

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:25.990
perhaps a retreat is in order.

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:29.130
If we suffer any more casualties,

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.910
we will fall behind the other armies 
in the assault on the mainland.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:35.190
There's no point in losing soldiers here...

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:37.500
No, Karaun.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:40.880
You can't let Ochirubato's body hear that!

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:45.360
We can't let them get away 
without paying a price for this!

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.240
Launch a full assault!

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:49.400
Crush them from all directions!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.900
We'll take out the enemy's general here,

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:03.960
and then we can see them really panic!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.470
Are you ready?

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:07.790
Yeah!

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:08.820
We'll follow you to the ends of hell!

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:10.740
Ride straight down the mountain!

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:12.860
If you're not a good rider, 
just believe in your horse!

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.990
Follow me!

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.770
He's riding straight down the steep 
mountain, as Yoshitsune once did...

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:26.430
There's no need to fear 
the feeble horses of the Japanese!

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.280
Fire!

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:41.170
You, samurai general!

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:43.780
Your head is mine!

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:57.430
<i>That's the guy from the corner 
on the cliff the other day!</i>

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:59.400
Attack, everyone!

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:01.710
Don't let us lose any more commanders!

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:09.970
I couldn't get close enough, huh?

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:11.050
Everyone...

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:13.650
The same as ever. Right, Boss?

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:16.370
Let's get the hell out of here, men!

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.950
Yeah, that's right!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.140
Don't let him escape!

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:24.210
Kill him before he gets to the castle!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:45.300
General, are you hurt?

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:50.070
He's still not going to break...

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:55.650
Even if we take down this castle,

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:58.650
we're going to lose a lot of our men.

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:01.970
That's depressing...

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:08.760
No, you could bring this castle 
down in a matter of hours!

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:12.090
But our mission is the invasion of Kyushu.

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:17.350
I believe we should let the others 
have this useless, crumbling castle.

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:19.550
You're still not giving up on that, huh?

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:24.830
But, well, you may be right.

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:26.780
Okay...

00:19:28.340 --> 00:19:31.430
I guess we'll just leave them be!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:38.060
Magistrate!

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:43.990
These men abandoned the west wall 
and allowed the enemy inside!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.650
I believe they deserve harsh punishment.

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:50.850
That samurai named Shiraishi 
told us to come help.

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:53.660
He said he'd give the signal 
if the enemy came.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:55.910
Shiraishi?

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:00.410
He said he was worried about the west wall,

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:01.970
and he volunteered to go there.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:05.320
But then he drove the others away...

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:06.670
That's strange.

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:10.690
It's like he was working with the Mongols.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:13.060
Don't you think so, Kuchii?

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.560
Hmph. Impossible.

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.640
Go take a look.

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:23.060
Either he died fighting the Mongols, 
and you'll see his body,

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.740
or he ran off with them and is long gone.

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:29.400
I'll go up the west wall.

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:45.540
<i>Nakamaru of Mitsuka...</i>

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:47.440
<i>He stayed to fight?</i>

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.740
You look like a living corpse.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.070
Kuchii.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.900
Glad you survived, Shiraishi.

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:19.010
The Mongols who came in this way 
disappeared with the smoke,

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:20.930
and so did the rest of the army.

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:35.810
Don't you want to go with them?

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:41.870
I was waiting for you, Kuchii Jinzaburou.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:54.930
Because without your head as a gift,

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:57.790
the Mongols won't let me go back!

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:10.010
<b>Episode 09: 
The Battle of the Mountain Castle</b>
